    <title>Harness-Controlled Research Runtime with Durable Evidence</title>
    <summary>
      We study a bounded research runtime that separates deterministic workflow
      control from language-model candidate generation. The runtime records
      source lineage, quality gates, durable artifacts, and replayable events.
    </summary>
